OL,3,GNEWSALong delays on A3 after car
OL,4,Aoverturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver and passenger were taken to
OL,7,Fhospital after a car overturned
OL,8,Fnorthbound on the A3, closing two
OL,9,Flanes.
OL,11,FSurrey Police was called to the scene
OL,12,Fnear Ockham at about 10:50 BST,
OL,13,Ffollowing a report of a single vehicle
OL,14,Fcollision.
OL,16,FAdvising motorists to prepare for
OL,17,Fdelays, the force said two people had
OL,18,Fbeen "safely recovered from the vehicle
OL,19,Fand have been taken to hospital for
OL,20,Fmedical treatment".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
